<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1700 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1700 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the</p>
<p>ninth day of the French Open tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>*3-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat 12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) 3-6</p>
<p>6-2 7-5</p>
<p>11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 2-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) 6-3 5-7</p>
<p>6-2.</p>
</text>
